[TITLE]
NUM-11: Type2 pump P1 (5 cfs at any depth) draws from junction wet well J1,
which is fed by conduit C0 falling freely into it (outlet offset 8 ft).
Inflow 6 cfs for 10 min (above the pump's capacity), then 1 cfs. J1 starts dry.
Correct result: once the inflow drops below 5 cfs, P1 draws J1 down to
near empty within seconds and then pumps the 1 cfs inflow.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         1
VARIABLE_STEP        0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J0     20   5        0         0        0
J1     0    10       0         0        0
J2     30   5        0         0        0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     29   FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length N InOffset OutOffset InitFlow
C0     J0  J1  200  0.013  0  8  0
C2     J2  O1  100  0.013  0  0  0

[PUMPS]
P1     J1  J2  PC1  ON  0  0

[CURVES]
PC1  PUMP2  0  5

[XSECTIONS]
C0     CIRCULAR 1 0 0 0 1
C2     CIRCULAR 2 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
J0  FLOW  TS1  FLOW 1.0 1.0 0

[TIMESERIES]
TS1  0:00  6
TS1  0:10  6
TS1  0:11  1
TS1  1:00  1

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
